{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"廣東省委書記黃坤明視察APEC新聞中心\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-15-12-21-198PTMWvoD.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】廣東省委書記黃坤明到APEC新聞中心視察。</p><p>黃坤明在深圳市市長李運等陪同下，參觀新聞中心演播廳和發布中心等，了解各項工作進程。</p><p>APEC會議周期間，廣東省共推出218個參訪點和43條路線予中外記者參訪。而會議舉行的核心場館，包括深圳國際交流中心、深圳灣文化廣場和前海國際會議中心等，亦已陸續準備就緒。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:15:57.927915+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:14:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:55:46.164053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:34.432928+00:00","content_hash":"01953908fe62946f56067ddb1943b2b75959a12c0fd168b7fbf01bcfab2edd38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}